{"term":{"label":"德","occurrences":7,"variants":[]},"source":{"id":"7B","url":"https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-ii","title":"盡心下","description":"孟子曰：「不仁哉，梁惠王也！仁者以其所愛及其所不愛，不仁者以其所不愛及其所愛。」\n公孫丑問曰：「何謂也？」\n「梁惠王以土地之故，糜爛其民而戰之，大敗，將復之，恐不能勝，故驅其所愛子弟以殉之，是之謂以其所不愛及其所愛也。」\n孟子曰：「《春秋》無義戰。彼善於此，則有之矣。征者上伐下也，敵國不相征也。」\n孟子曰：「盡信《書》"},"network":{"directed":false,"multigraph":false,"graph":{},"nodes":[{"form":"上","id":"上"},{"form":"世","id":"世"},{"form":"亂","id":"亂"},{"form":"今","id":"今"},{"form":"原","id":"原"},{"form":"孔子","id":"孔子"},{"form":"德","id":"德"},{"form":"心","id":"心"},{"form":"恐","id":"恐"},{"form":"惡","id":"惡"},{"form":"文","id":"文"},{"form":"王","id":"王"},{"form":"百","id":"百"},{"form":"義","id":"義"},{"form":"至","id":"至"},{"form":"鄉","id":"郷"}],"edges":[{"weight":1.5824092400461809,"source":"至","target":"心"},{"weight":1.5824092400461809,"source":"至","target":"德"},{"weight":2.2755564206061263,"source":"至","target":"文"},{"weight":1.9390841839849136,"source":"至","target":"王"},{"weight":0.994622575144062,"source":"至","target":"孔子"},{"weight":1.8055527913603908,"source":"至","target":"今"},{"weight":3.0376964726530233,"source":"郷","target":"原"},{"weight":1.5824092400461809,"source":"郷","target":"德"},{"weight":1.1124056108004454,"source":"郷","target":"世"},{"weight":3.1918471524802814,"source":"郷","target":"惡"},{"weight":0.8247235383486646,"source":"亂","target":"世"},{"weight":1.9878743481543455,"source":"亂","target":"德"},{"weight":1.5178707189086098,"source":"亂","target":"上"},{"weight":2.498699971920336,"source":"亂","target":"義"},{"weight":2.9041650800285006,"source":"亂","target":"恐"},{"weight":2.093234863812172,"source":"恐","target":"義"},{"weight":1.5824092400461809,"source":"恐","target":"德"},{"weight":2.6164830075767194,"source":"百","target":"世"},{"weight":2.211017899468555,"source":"百","target":"上"},{"weight":1.2947271675944,"source":"世","target":"德"},{"weight":1.5178707189086098,"source":"世","target":"上"},{"weight":0.9582549309731873,"source":"世","target":"原"},{"weight":1.1769441319380167,"s